occupational antigens,

528
00:28:56,290 --> 00:28:58,310
manifesting interstitial
lung disease.

529
00:28:58,510 --> 00:29:00,950
Individuals affected
by hypersensitivity

530
00:29:00,950 --> 00:29:02,730
