chemical workers lung.

535
00:29:13,110 --> 00:29:15,310
In terms of the etiology of

536
00:29:15,310 --> 00:29:16,910
hypersensitivity pneumonitis,

537
00:29:16,910 --> 00:29:20,730
it is a combined type 3
and type 4 hypersensitivity

538
00:29:20,730 --> 00:29:23,190
reaction with genetic
predisposition.

539
00:29:23,190 --> 00:29:26,150
This is caused by inhalation
of organic particles

540
00:29:26,150 --> 00:29:28,630
primarily through
occupational exposure.

541
00:29:29,250 --> 00:29:31,550
In terms of clinical features,

542
00:29:31,730 --> 00:29:34,790
hypersensitivity pneumonitis
presents acutely with

543
00:29:34,790 --> 00:29:38,510
