present with dyspnea without

545
00:29:41,310 --> 00:29:44,930
wheezing, chest tightness,
and a few spine crackles.

546
00:29:45,390 --> 00:29:47,750
Symptoms usually
subside within hours to

547
00:29:47,750 --> 00:29:50,050
