551
00:29:58,850 --> 00:29:59,850
cyanosis,

552
00:29:59,930 --> 00:30:02,270
bilateral arrails,
and even weight loss.

553
00:30:02,610 --> 00:30:05,210
A recurring common
cold with an irritating

554
00:30:05,210 --> 00:30:07,390
cough and fever may indicate a

555
00:30:07,390 --> 00:30:09,470
patient has hypersensitivity
pneumonitis.

556
00:30:10,170 --> 00:30:12,330
In terms of diagnosis,

557
00:30:12,350 --> 00:30:15,030
the diagnosis is based
on a history of antigen

558
00:30:15,030 --> 00:30:17,610
exposure, typical
clinical and radiological

559
00:30:17,610 --> 00:30:19,990
features, and supportive
diagnostic testing.

560
00:30:20,130 --> 00:30:23,610
A high-resolution CT can
be used, which would show

561
00:30:23,610 --> 00:30:26,530
honeycombing, which is
irreversible fibrotic changes,

562
00:30:26,870 --> 00:30:29,470
thickening of alveolar
septic, traction

563
00:30:29,470 --> 00:30:31,850
bronchiectasis or
bronchiolectasis,

564
00:30:32,070 --> 00:30:33,610
ground glass opacities with

565
00:30:33,610 --> 00:30:35,270
