596
00:32:09,460 --> 00:32:11,620
Sarcoidosis is another
interstitial lung

597
00:32:11,620 --> 00:32:14,940
disease in which the cause
of it is unknown, but

598
00:32:14,940 --> 00:32:17,780
genetic predisposition,
