600
00:32:20,460 --> 00:32:22,880
infectious agents are
believed to play a role.

601
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:27,680
The average age of onset
is 30 to 55 years of

602
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:29,900
age. The prevalence
