603
00:32:29,900 --> 00:32:32,740
American and Scandinavian
female populations.

604
00:32:32,940 --> 00:32:36,940
In terms of clinical
features, sarcoidosis is a

605
00:32:36,940 --> 00:32:40,340
disease with highly variable
manifestations, ranging

606
00:32:40,340 --> 00:32:43,260
from asymptomatic to
progressive relapsing disease.

607
00:32:43,940 --> 00:32:46,380
Typically, sudden
onset with spontaneous

608
00:32:46,380 --> 00:32:48,940
remission occurs in
approximately two-thirds of

609
00:32:48,940 --> 00:32:51,460
patients, and approximately
one-third of patients

610
00:32:51,460 --> 00:32:53,460
will develop to progressive
chronic disease.

611
00:32:54,100 --> 00:32:56,880
The most common presenting
signs and symptoms

612
00:32:56,880 --> 00:33:00,220
include asymptomatic and
early stages, and then

613
00:33:00,220 --> 00:33:03,500
going to general symptoms
of fever, malaise, lack

614
00:33:03,500 --> 00:33:06,050
of appetite, weight loss,
and lymphadenopathy.

615
00:33:06,360 --> 00:33:08,560
In terms of pulmonary,
patients will

616
00:33:08,560 --> 00:33:10,400
have dyspnea, cough,
and chest pain.

617
00:33:10,460 --> 00:33:13,820
In terms of extrapulmonary,
patients may have arthritis,

618
00:33:13,860 --> 00:33:17,080
erythema nendosum, as
well as anterior uveitis.

619
00:33:18,500 --> 00:33:21,560
Sarcoidosis is a multi
-system inflammatory disorder

620
00:33:21,560 --> 00:33:24,560
characterized by non
-caseating granuloma formation,

621
00:33:24,560 --> 00:33:27,500
most commonly in the lung
and hyaluronic nodes.

622
00:33:27,820 --> 00:33:29,540
This image here depicts a non

623
00:33:29,540 --> 00:33:32,020
-caseating granuloma
and sarcoidosis.

624
00:33:33,280 --> 00:33:36,660
The differentiation and
clonal expansion of T-cells,

625
00:33:36,660 --> 00:33:39,180
as well as T-cell recruitment
and D-cell activity,

626
00:33:39,180 --> 00:33:41,670
results in local immune
hyperactivity and

627
00:33:41,670 --> 00:33:43,980
inflammation, resulting in
that formation of the non

628
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:47,100
-caseating granulomas in the
lungs and lymphatic system.

629
00:33:50,700 --> 00:33:53,660
This schematic here
represents sarcoidosis

630
00:33:53,660 --> 00:33:55,480
pathophysiology and
is important for

631
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:57,700
answering a lot of board
-relevant questions.

632
00:33:57,820 --> 00:34:03,300
In terms of how sarcoidosis
ends up with granuloma

633
00:34:03,300 --> 00:34:05,680
formation, fibrosis,
as well as calcium

634
00:34:05,680 --> 00:34:09,100
dysregulation, can all be
found here in this schematic.

635
00:34:09,420 --> 00:34:11,680
It starts with
inhalation of foreign

636
00:34:11,680 --> 00:34:14,020
antigen, generating
monocyte differentiation,

637
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:16,660
which leads to the
activation of both

638
00:34:16,660 --> 00:34:18,720
