cells as well

639
00:34:18,720 --> 00:34:20,840
as pulmonary
alveolar macrophages.

640
00:34:21,160 --> 00:34:23,780
The interstitial
dendritic cells migrate

641
00:34:23,780 --> 00:34:25,600
towards the
mediastinal lymph nodes

642
00:34:25,600 --> 00:34:27,700
and alveolar macrophages
differentiate,

643
00:34:27,900 --> 00:34:29,540
serving as an
antigen-presenting

644
00:34:29,540 --> 00:34:32,140
cells to circulating
T helper cells.

645
00:34:32,220 --> 00:34:34,060
This results in differentiation

646
00:34:34,060 --> 00:34:36,280
and clonal expansion
of T cells.

647
00:34:36,920 --> 00:34:39,800
T cell recruitment and
increased V cell activity

648
00:34:39,800 --> 00:34:43,540
results in local immune
hyperactivity and inflammation,

649
00:34:43,660 --> 00:34:46,250
thus helping the
formation of non-caseating

650
00:34:46,250 --> 00:34:48,580
granulomas in the lung
and lymphatic system.

651
00:34:49,260 --> 00:34:53,740
