as well as fibroblasts.

658
00:35:12,720 --> 00:35:15,800
The recruitment of the
fibroblasts leads to fibrosis

659
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:17,800
and eventually damage
of organs and tissues.

660
00:35:18,700 --> 00:35:22,540
This all results in the
granuloma formation, as mature

661
00:35:22,540 --> 00:35:24,980
