of epithelioid cells and

662
00:35:24,980 --> 00:35:28,040
macrophages surrounded by
lymphocytes and fibroblasts.

663
00:35:28,260 --> 00:35:31,660
The pulmonary alveolar
macrophages also increase

664
00:35:31,660 --> 00:35:34,600
1-alpha-hydroxylase
excretion and activity.

665
00:35:34,990 --> 00:35:37,860
This will then lead
to increase of 125

666
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:40,720
-dihydroxyl vitamin
D, or calcitriol,

667
00:35:40,900 --> 00:35:44,760
which will then result
