668
00:35:44,920 --> 00:35:48,760
This then results in
hyperphosphatemia, hypercalcemia,

669
00:35:48,760 --> 00:35:50,720
which is the calcium
dysregulation that you can

670
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:54,420
