as possible renal failure.

671
00:35:58,380 --> 00:36:00,820
Sarcoidosis is a
diagnosis of exclusion

672
00:36:00,820 --> 00:36:03,100
supported by characteristic
clinical features

673
00:36:03,100 --> 00:36:05,500
and or findings on
chest imaging, as

674
00:36:05,500 --> 00:36:08,240
well as non-caseating
granulomas on biopsy.

675
00:36:08,590 --> 00:36:11,300
In terms of laboratory
studies, a CDC

676
00:36:11,300 --> 00:36:14,040
