with giant cells.

698
00:37:26,300 --> 00:37:29,540
You'll also see asteroid
bodies and you can

699
00:37:29,540 --> 00:37:32,090
also and the asteroid
bodies are star-shaped

700
00:37:32,090 --> 00:37:34,940
geosinophilic inclusion
body in the cytoplasm of

701
